\f1\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 Overview of Asset Optimization Settings\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 Asset Optimization is found in the "Automatically created assets" section of your Performance Max campaign settings. This feature gives Google permission to create and modify your ad assets automatically. There are three main categories of asset optimization:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Text Assets
\f0\b0 \
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Image Assets
\f0\b0 \
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Video Assets
\f0\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 Text Assets\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 Text asset optimization includes two distinct options that control how Google can modify your ad copy:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 Text Customization\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 This setting allows Google to create asset text from your site landing pages, existing ads, and provided assets. When enabled, Google can customize your ad copy automatically based on what it finds on your website.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Google pulls content from your landing pages\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Creates variations of your existing ad copy\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Customizes assets based on relevance signals\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 Final URL Expansion\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 This feature allows your Performance Max campaign to act more like a Dynamic Search Ad (DSA) campaign. When enabled, Google can send traffic to landing pages beyond what you specify in your final URL, based on what it determines will perform best for specific searches.\
\uc0\u55357 \u56481 
\f2\i\b Pro Tip:
\f3\b0  If you enable Final URL expansion, make sure to exclude URLs you don't want Google sending traffic to. This could include blog posts, articles, or product categories not relevant to your specific campaign.
\f0\i0 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 Image Assets\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 Image asset optimization provides two options for automatically managing your visual creative:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 Image Enhancement\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 This allows Google to adjust your uploaded images for better appearance across different ad placements. Google may crop, resize, or optimize images to fit various formats and improve visual appeal.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 Landing Page Images\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 When enabled, Google can pull images directly from your landing pages to use in your ads. This expands your creative options without requiring manual uploads.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Google automatically identifies relevant images on your pages\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Images are selected based on quality and relevance\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Can expand your creative library without manual effort\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 Video Assets\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 Video Enhancement\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 This option allows Google to enhance your uploaded YouTube videos by creating additional versions optimized for different placements:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0
\f1\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Vertical versions
\f0\b0  - Optimized for mobile and YouTube Shorts\
\ls4\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Square versions
\f0\b0  - Better suited for certain display placements\
\ls4\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Shorter versions
\f0\b0  - Condensed edits for quick-view placements\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 This functions similarly to responsive search ads but for video content\'97Google takes your uploaded video and dynamically creates variations to run across different video placements, including YouTube Shorts.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 Recommendations by Campaign Type\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 Your asset optimization settings should align with your campaign structure and goals:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 Feed-Only Asset Groups (Starting Out)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 When running a feed-only Performance Max campaign (no creative assets, just product feed), you should turn off most asset optimization settings:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl0
\f1\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Text Customization:
\f0\b0  OFF\
\ls5\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Final URL Expansion:
\f0\b0  OFF\
\ls5\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Image Enhancement:
\f0\b0  OFF\
\ls5\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Landing Page Images:
\f0\b0  OFF\
\ls5\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	5	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Video Enhancement:
\f0\b0  OFF\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 Full Asset Groups\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 When running full asset groups with complete creative (images, videos, ad copy), you can be more selective with optimization settings:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls6\ilvl0
\f1\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Text Customization:
\f0\b0  OFF (or test with caution)\
\ls6\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Final URL Expansion:
\f0\b0  ON (with URL exclusions)\
\ls6\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Image Enhancement:
\f0\b0  ON\
\ls6\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Landing Page Images:
\f0\b0  Test (be cautious)\
\ls6\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	5	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Video Enhancement:
\f0\b0  ON\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

