\f1\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 Best Practices\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 Monitor Asset Performance\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 If you enable text customization, regularly review the asset performance reports to ensure Google's automatically created copy aligns with your brand voice and messaging. Look for any assets that may be underperforming or off-brand.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 Use URL Exclusions with Final URL Expansion\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 When enabling Final URL expansion, always set up URL exclusions to prevent Google from sending traffic to pages you don't want used in your campaigns:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls7\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Blog posts and articles (unless relevant to your campaign)\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Product categories outside your campaign focus\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Contact, about, or policy pages\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Out-of-stock or discontinued product pages\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 Start Conservative, Then Expand\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 When first launching a Performance Max campaign, start with most asset optimization settings turned off. As your campaign matures and you have conversion data, you can test enabling additional features one at a time to measure their impact.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 \uc0\u9888 \u65039  Warning: If you enable text customization without monitoring, Google may create ad copy that doesn't match your brand standards or contains messaging you wouldn't approve. Always review automated assets regularly.
\f0\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

